{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1795004674","published":"2026-11-18T12:24:48Z","modified":"2026-11-20T10:28:33.111610574Z","upstream":["CVE-2025-11395","CVE-2026-111943","CVE-2026-39834","CVE-2026-46597"],"summary":"podman: Fix of 4 CVEs","details":"- CVE-2025-11395: confine tar extraction to the destination directory and the\n  reads of an extracted oci-archive to its temporary directory, so a crafted\n  archive given to podman load or podman volume import can no longer create or\n  overwrite files outside of it (vendored containers/storage and\n  containers/image)\n- CVE-2026-39834: fix an endless loop when one ssh channel write is 4 GiB or\n  larger, in the golang.org/x/crypto/ssh copies vendored by podman and by the\n  bundled gvisor-tap-vsock (gvproxy)\n- CVE-2026-46597: fix a panic on a crafted padding length in an AES-GCM ssh\n  packet, in the golang.org/x/crypto/ssh copies vendored by podman and by the\n  bundled gvisor-tap-vsock (gvproxy)\n- CVE-2026-111943: rebuild against golang >= 1.22.9-1.el9_2.tuxcare.els31 to\n  stop crypto/x509 Verify from trusting compromised intermediate CAs","affected":[{"package":{"name":"podman","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.2","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/podman?distro=almalinux-9.2"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2:4.4.1-13.el9_2.tuxcare.els23"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/almalinux9.2esu/CLSA-2026-1795004674.json"}},{"package":{"name":"podman-docker","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.2","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/podman-docker?distro=almalinux-9.2"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2:4.4.1-13.el9_2.tuxcare.els23"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/almalinux9.2esu/CLSA-2026-1795004674.json"}},{"package":{"name":"podman-gvproxy","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.2","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/podman-gvproxy?distro=almalinux